 beautiful volume in which you  will find my original drawings for more  than 10 years ago  an exploration of the symbolism of saint  christopher  and an exclusive text by mathieu pedro  on the symbolism of the biblical samson  this is the first thing that matthieu  has published since his groundbreaking  book the language of creation  so jump into the margins with us be part  of this shift in storytelling where the  end becomes the beginning and where the  monster carries the king  into a new world  you
 

